{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_object_storage_snapshot_store_backend_objectstoragesnapshotstore", "label": "ObjectStorageSnapshotStore", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/object-storage/snapshot-store-backend.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Drei Muster: cluster-weit geteilte Snapshots fuer wandernde Sharded Entities (SQLite pro Node reicht dafuer nicht), verschluesselte Snapshots fuer Compliance, guenstiger Storage fuer selten gelesene Daten."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_object_storage_snapshot_store_backend_objectstoragesnapshotstoreoptions", "label": "ObjectStorageSnapshotStoreOptionsType", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/object-storage/snapshot-store-backend.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_object_storage_snapshot_store_backend_keepn", "label": "keepN-Pruning (Default 3)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/object-storage/snapshot-store-backend.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Pruning ist standardmaessig aktiv, damit LISTs pro pid beschraenkt bleiben; nur keepN: 0 laesst eine pid unbegrenzt Snapshots ansammeln, sodass jedes loadLatest-LIST alle zurueckgibt."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_object_storage_snapshot_store_backend_snapshot_key_layout", "label": "Snapshot-Key-Layout <prefix>/<persistenceId>/seq-<seqNr>", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/object-storage/snapshot-store-backend.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Das Framework listet unter <prefix>/<pid>/, um den neuesten Snapshot zu finden - alle Entity-Typen unter denselben Prefix ohne Per-pid-Unterordner zu packen macht das teuer."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_object_storage_snapshot_store_backend_snapshot_lifecycle", "label": "Snapshot-Lifecycle (Save nach Policy, Load per LIST + GET)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/object-storage/snapshot-store-backend.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_object_storage_snapshot_store_backend_cachedsnapshotstore_wrapping", "label": "Mit CachedSnapshotStore fuer Hot-Path-Loads einwickeln", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/object-storage/snapshot-store-backend.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_object_storage_snapshot_store_backend_journal_snapshotstore_independence", "label": "Journal und Snapshot-Store sind unabhaengig", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/object-storage/snapshot-store-backend.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "SQLite-Journal + ObjectStorage-Snapshots (lokale Event-Rate, geteilte Snapshots fuer Sharded Entities), Cassandra-Journal + ObjectStorage-Snapshots, oder alles Object Storage - langsamer pro Op, aber billig."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_object_storage_snapshot_store_backend_objectstoragesnapshotstore", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_object_storage_snapshot_store_backend_objectstoragesnapshotstoreoptions", "relation": "shares_data_with", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/object-storage/snapshot-store-bac